{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Refactor BaseDefinition in Spring XD to remove embedded module lists and perform lazy reparsing of module definitions when accessed.",
    "Implement explicit hflush/hsync calls and synchronous acknowledgement mechanisms in HDFS sink modules to guarantee physical disk commits before acknowledging message bus receipts.",
    "Enhance Spring XD module deployment properties and DSL to allow overriding SpEL partition key expressions and custom PartitionKeyGenerator instances at individual module scope.",
    "Modify message bus binder abstraction (e.g., Kafka/Rabbit) to support multi-topic/partition binding syntax and route incoming messages into a single internal message queue.",
    "Develop a context-tolerant DSL parser variant for Flo UI that allows validating partial stream snippets and unresolved tap references without throwing global stream resolution errors.",
    "Utilize custom Tuple serialization/deserialization handlers to capture and re-inject non-default ConfigurableConversionService instances across process boundaries.",
    "Establish automated JMH/Gatling benchmark harnesses for stream pipelines to accurately measure throughput, latency, and resource overhead under JMX-enabled vs. JMX-disabled configurations."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Development work will be performed on the existing Spring XD codebase by a single developer familiar with Spring Framework, Spring Integration, and messaging architectures.",
    "Local Docker-based or sandbox instances of HDFS, Kafka, and RabbitMQ are available for running integration tests.",
    "User story U1 builds directly upon the existing experimental branch 'deploy-refactor-2'.",
    "Single-container stream deployment (U6) requires architectural design, spike implementation, and documentation, but not a full multi-container deployment orchestrator replacement in this increment.",
    "Workdays are based on an 8-hour workday of effective engineering work."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-01",
      "activity_name": "U1: Refactor BaseDefinition and Reparsing Logic",
      "activity_description": "Analyze existing branch 'deploy-refactor-2', remove the explicit list of modules from BaseDefinition, implement on-demand re-parsing mechanism, and update dependent module management classes and unit tests.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-02",
      "activity_name": "U2: Reliable HDFS Writes and Commit Acknowledgment",
      "activity_description": "Enhance HDFS sink modules to support hsync/hflush options, integrate downstream flush confirmations with message bus consumer acknowledgments, and write integration tests verifying commit guarantees.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-03",
      "activity_name": "U3: Module-Level Partition Function Override",
      "activity_description": "Add configuration support to override partition key generator and selector functions directly within source and processor module definitions, updating partition routing components.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-04",
      "activity_name": "U4: Consume Multiple Topic-Partitions into Single Queue",
      "activity_description": "Update inbound channel adapters and message binders to accept comma-separated or wildcard topic-partition specs, unifying incoming streams into a single channel queue.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-05",
      "activity_name": "U5: Context-Tolerant DSL Parser for Flo UI",
      "activity_description": "Design and implement a lenient/partial Stream DSL parser that validates syntax, module names, and option key-values for standalone UI snippets containing taps on unparsed streams.",
      "most_likely_effort": 5.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-06",
      "activity_name": "U6: Single-Container Stream Deployment Design and Spike",
      "activity_description": "Investigate, prototype, and document architectural approach for collocating all stream modules inside a single container using direct in-memory message channels.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-07",
      "activity_name": "U7: Uniform ConfigurableConversionService Tuple Deserialization",
      "activity_description": "Fix Tuple serialization routines to correctly preserve and re-apply non-default ConfigurableConversionService instances post-deserialization without resetting to defaults.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-08",
      "activity_name": "U8: JMX Enabled vs. Disabled Stream Benchmarking",
      "activity_description": "Construct benchmark pipeline scenarios, measure throughput/latency/CPU/memory differences with and without JMX enabled, and compile a performance evaluation report.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-09",
      "activity_name": "End-to-End Integration Testing & Documentation",
      "activity_description": "Perform comprehensive end-to-end testing across all integrated user stories, ensure build pipeline stability, and update user and developer documentation.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.0
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 30.0
  }
}
```

